{"id":"3e67b95ae03ab963","group":"58","path":"58/batch18/58-prop-union.md","title":"Union Properties","display":"prop-union — Union Properties","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-prop-union","aliases":["58-prop-union"],"display":"prop-union — Union Properties","depends_on":["[[58-df-union]]","[[../batch12/58-df-set.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-prop-union"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-prop-union</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-union — Union Properties"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5a295a90caf70085\" href=\"?note=5a295a90caf70085\" title=\"58-df-union\">58-df-union</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"65d9a1e690c32aad\" href=\"?note=65d9a1e690c32aad\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-set.md\">../batch12/58-df-set.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{F}\">\\(\\mathcal{F}\\)</span> (集合族)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> (集合, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"65d9a1e690c32aad\" href=\"?note=65d9a1e690c32aad\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-set.md\">../batch12/58-df-set.md</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}union} \\vdash \\bigcup \\mathcal{F} = \\{x : \\exists A \\in \\mathcal{F}\\;(x \\in A)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}union} \\vdash \\bigcup \\mathcal{F} = \\{x : \\exists A \\in \\mathcal{F}\\;(x \\in A)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The union of a family of sets is the set of all elements belonging to some member of the family.</li>\n<li>Binary union is the special case <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{F} = \\{A, B\\}\">\\(\\mathcal{F} = \\{A, B\\}\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-union","status":"resolved","id":"5a295a90caf70085","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-union]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"65d9a1e690c32aad","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-set.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"65d9a1e690c32aad","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$X$ (集合, see [[../batch12/58-df-set.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal{F}","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}union} \\vdash \\bigcup \\mathcal{F} = \\{x : \\exists A \\in \\mathcal{F}\\;(x \\in A)\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal{F} = \\{A, B\\}","display":false}],"bytes":669,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4012","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-prop-union.md|58-prop-union]]（batch18）"}],"outgoing":["5a295a90caf70085","65d9a1e690c32aad"]}